OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro lands in Miami after
OL,4,Adefeat in Brazil's presidential
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrazilian Senator Flavio Bolsonaro has
OL,8,Fflown to Miami after losing the
OL,9,Fcountry's presidential election on
OL,10,FSunday.
OL,12,FHis arrival in Florida ends days of
OL,13,Fconfusion over his whereabouts, after
OL,14,Fhe was reported to have travelled to
OL,15,FArgentina, and then prematurely
OL,16,Freported to have already entered the US
OL,17,Fon Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
