OL,3,AFlavio Bolsonaro lands in Miami after
OL,4,Adefeat in Brazil's presidential
OL,5,Aelection
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe US has said it would grant visas to
OL,8,FBolsonaro and his family, who travelled
OL,9,Fwith him. Brazil cancelled his
OL,10,Fpassport, after he failed to surrender
OL,11,Fit to authorities, due to an ongoing
OL,12,Fcriminal investigation. He has denied
OL,13,Fany wrongdoing.
OL,15,FIn a statement, Bolsonaro cast himself
OL,16,F"as the true elected president of
OL,17,FBrazil", and thanked the American
OL,18,Fgovernment for granting entry to his
OL,19,Ffamily.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
